+    <p>Our responses carry a strict <code>Referrer-Policy</code> and a restrictive <code>Permissions-Policy</code>, so other origins never learn which page you were on, and features such as camera, microphone, geolocation, motion sensors and the browser's ad-topics API are disabled for this site and anything it embeds.</p>
