+    <h3>Article images</h3>
+    <p>Most images are served from our own servers. A small number of articles embed images hosted by Imgur or on Google Cloud Run; when such an article is opened, your browser requests the image directly from that host, which therefore sees your IP address. Because of our referrer policy, the host learns only that the request came from this site, not which article you were reading.</p>
